WIND RELEASE TECHNIQUE COMPENDIUM -- HIDDEN SAND

Wind (Fuuton) is the dominant chakra nature of the Land of Wind and the
signature of Sunagakure's shinobi. The desert breeds those who turn the very
air into a blade.

Core techniques taught at chunin level and above:
- Wind Release: Great Breakthrough -- a concentrated gale that flattens
  formations and clears sandstorms.
- Wind Release: Great Sickle Weasel Technique -- a cutting whirlwind, best
  channeled through a battle fan (see Temari's three-moon tessen).
- Wind Release: Vacuum blades -- compressed air projectiles from breath or
  weapon.
- Cooperative summoning: the weasel Kamatari, called to ride a wind blast.

Training doctrine: Wind users pair naturally with lightning allies and counter
earth-users. In the desert, wind jutsu double as survival tools -- dispersing
sandstorms and shaping dunes for cover. Advance only under a qualified jonin.
